  "description": {
   "en": "The death of an Ayakashi is unclean - It is an impure occurence that corrodes the land, and occasionally gives birth to monsters. This is the story of the \"Ayakashi undertakers\" who exorcise these impurities and watch over the deaths of these fantastical beings.",
   "ja": "あやかしの死を見つめる追悼奇譚開幕。あやかしの死に、穢れあり。それは土地を蝕み、時に化け者を生む、妖しき死の名残り…。あやかし殺しの罪人・八重波は、穢れを祓う葬儀屋の元で働くこととなり…。人とあやかし、生者と死者。"
  },
